  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.CardanoOASIS v2.0.4\n\nConnects the OASIS to Cardano -- a peer-reviewed, research-first proof-of-stake blockchain with Ouroboros consensus and Plutus smart contracts. Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and metadata on Cardano with energy-efficient PoS security. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.3\n- docs(packages): add missing NuGet guides and release setup sections (77c65ea)\n- fix(packaging): explicitly include newly documented package readmes (5be30be)\n- fix(runtime): share pinned HoloNET crypto implementation across providers (2311d57)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.CardanoOASIS",
